<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 5.0 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 5.0 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 5.0 trillion lire repurchase tender for today or tomorrow for government securities to be resold on December 13.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 6.5 trillion lire on November 26, the minimum accepted rate stood at 7.93 percent and the average rate at 7.95 percent.</p>
